// A duty is violated when it holds and one of its `Violated when` conditions holds.
Fact x Identified by Int
Duty keep-odd Holder actor Claimant actor'
  Violated when (Exists x: x % 2 == 0).
+actor(Alice). +actor(Bob).
+keep-odd(Alice, Bob).
+x(1).
?!Violated(keep-odd(Alice, Bob)).
+x(2).
?Violated(keep-odd(Alice, Bob)).
